al of <math alttext=\"negative five sixths\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> is <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the slope of line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Since the slope of line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> is the same between any two points on line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>, a point lies on line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> if the slope of the line segment connecting the point and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma negative 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Substituting choice C, <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 10 comma 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, for <math alttext=\"left parenthesis a comma b right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma negative 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> for <math alttext=\"left parenthesis c comma d right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in the expression <math alttext=\"StartFraction d minus b Over c minus a EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction negative 4 minus 2 Over 5 minus 10 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 10 comma 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. The slope of the line segment connecting <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma six fifths right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma negative 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction negative 4 minus six fifths Over 5 minus 0 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"negative StartFraction 26 Over 25 EndFraction\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. The slope of the line segment connecting <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 7 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma negative 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction negative 4 minus 7 Over 5 minus 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"negative 11\"><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"six fifths\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. The slope of the line segment connecting <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 11 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 5 comma